sequenceDiagram
  participant Market as Market-data adapter
  participant App as Application workflow
  participant Policy as Strategy domain
  participant Broker as Trading port
  participant Ledger as Fill / inventory ledger

  Market->>App: Canonical last-trade observation
  App->>Policy: Evaluate market state and BUY/SELL policy
  Policy-->>App: Order intent or refusal
  App->>Broker: Submit/cancel only after safety gates
  Broker-->>App: Acknowledgement / rejection / unknown outcome
  Note over App,Ledger: Acknowledgement never creates economic accounting
  Broker-->>App: Canonical order update and actual fills
  App->>Ledger: Apply immutable fills idempotently
  Ledger-->>App: Updated state or discrepancy
  App->>Policy: Re-evaluate only after required order reconciliation